Vendored code
-------------
miripple_comfy/vendor/mi_ripple/ contains the Python package src/mi_ripple of
https://github.com/miyang-ai/Mi-Ripple at commit 865a1481acc22da80427bbebe11f1d7f00dc99be,
licensed under the MIT License:

  Copyright (c) 2026 MIYANG Technology (Shanghai) Co., Ltd.

The full upstream license text is in miripple_comfy/vendor/LICENSE.mi-ripple.

Modification: reference.py carries one local patch, patches/0001-detect-faces-best-effort.patch
(optional OpenCV face detection made best-effort; the same change is proposed upstream as
miyang-ai/Mi-Ripple#2). All other vendored files are byte-identical to the upstream commit; per-file
hashes are listed in miripple_comfy/vendor/VENDOR.json.

tests/upstream_synthetic.py is upstream tests/synthetic.py from the same commit (same MIT license and
copyright), unmodified, used only by the tests and the CI parity check; it is not part of the Registry package.

The vendored regeneration module (MIYANG image API client) is present only because the upstream pipeline
imports it. This package never enables regeneration and never sends images anywhere.
